[statement]
A package not installed, whose condition names a package placed, leads the
walk to the package installed that provides a name it provides: placing
`o` reaches `md`, whose condition names it and which is not installed,
and `md` provides `dev`, which `bmo` provides, so `bmo` follows `o`, before
`ac`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:ac bmo

P:ac
V:1
D:o

P:bmo
V:1
p:dev

P:md
V:1
p:dev
i:o mdevd

P:o
V:1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install o 1
install bmo 1
install ac 1
install top 1
